                                                "sense_id": "1ad3b3ec-6056-3ffb-970c-4972c963ebb5",
                                                "text": "He also made a sampler CD, with one minute samples of 26 of their songs, for free distribution to people they met in Buffalo, and to others who showed an interest in their music."
